[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-012-backend-api-integration-pattern.md#after-react-query-pattern]

#### After: React Query Pattern

**Claims Module (After):**

```typescript
// claims-mfe/src/pages/ClaimsList.tsx (AFTER)
import { useClaims } from '../hooks/useClaims';

export function ClaimsList({ memberId }: { memberId: string }) {
  const { data, isLoading, error, refetch } = useClaims(memberId);

  if (isLoading) return <LoadingSpinner />;
  if (error) return <ErrorMessage error={error} onRetry={refetch} />;

  return (
    <ul>
      {data.data.map((claim) => (
        <li key={claim.id}>
          {claim.claimNumber} - {claim.status}  {/* Always fresh! */}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  );
}

// Hook implementation (shared across modules)
// claims-mfe/src/hooks/useClaims.ts
import { useQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query';
import { claimsAPIClient } from '@gainwell/shared-lib/api';

export function useClaims(memberId: string, page: number = 1) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ['claims', memberId, page],
    queryFn: () => claimsAPIClient.getClaims({ memberId, page }),
    enabled: !!memberId, // Only fetch if memberId provided
    staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000, // Data fresh for 5 minutes
    retry: 3, // Retry 3 times on failure
  });
}
```

**Improvements:**
1. ✅ **Reduced Code**: Module reduced from 50 lines to 10 lines (80% reduction)
2. ✅ **Automatic Caching**: Data cached for 5 minutes; no redundant fetches
3. ✅ **Real-Time Updates**: Backend events invalidate cache → auto-refetch
4. ✅ **Automatic Retry**: Network errors retry 3 times with exponential backoff
5. ✅ **Race Condition Prevention**: React Query cancels outdated requests automatically
6. ✅ **No Memory Leaks**: React Query handles cleanup (no manual `cancelled` flag)
